### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### News query (stateless)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Summarize the latest market news regarding the rupee falling against dollar and also currency exchange rate of dollar and rupee.",
  "reset": true
}

### Company-specific query (keeps conversation history)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "which country is going to suffer the most in isreal-US-iran conflict?"
}

### Clear history and ask a follow-up
POST http://localhost:8000/api/news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "hello, i am shashank who are you?",
  "reset": true
}

